[16.340583, "o", "--- /home/user/Documents/Novels/Pass Through/Chapter0.txt\r\n"]
[16.3462, "o", "Chapter 1 Passing through the book\r\n\r\nAs soon as Chi Qingluo opened his eyes, he found that he was sleeping in the bathtub, and the cell phone placed on the cabinet next to him was ringing alarmingly.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                 She leaned half of her body out of the water and took the phone.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[16.347753, "o", "--- /home/user/Documents/Novels/Pass Through/Chapter1.txt\r\n"]
[16.350062, "o", "Chapter 2 Change\r\n\r\nQin Yan paused and frowned slightly.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                 \"Just a few minutes!\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[16.350541, "o", "--- /home/user/Documents/Novels/Pass Through/Chapter2.txt\r\n"]
[16.353426, "o", "Chapter 3 Plan\r\n\r\nUm? ?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                 Chi Qingluo paused while biting the lion's head. The original owner was on a diet?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[16.353804, "o", "--- /home/user/Documents/Novels/Pass Through/Chapter3.txt\r\n"]
[16.355494, "o", "Chapter 4 Black Material\r\n\r\n\"Silence does not mean admitting defeat, but public relations still need to be done. Let's lower the heat first.\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                 Sister Ji thought for a while and nodded, \"Okay, I will do the public relations for this matter, and I will also negotiate with the endorsement company. Now I will send you home first, and you stay at home and don't act like a monster.\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[16.355903, "o", "--- /home/user/Documents/Novels/Pass Through/Chapter4.txt\r\n"]
[16.359026, "o", "Chapter 5: Ask him to pay back the money\r\n\r\nIn the Qin family's study room, the man was working hard at the table. The cold lights in the room outlined his thin outline, and the breath on his body became colder and colder.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                 \"Ayan.\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[16.359374, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b[01;32magent@6934aa39976b\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m/app\u001b[00m$ "]
[52.830765, "i", "cat > /tmp/build_pass_through.py <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re, uuid, zipfile, html\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\n\nroot = Path('/home/user/Documents/Novels/Pass Through')\nfiles = sorted(root.glob('Chapter*.txt'), key=lambda p: int(re.search(r'\\d+', p.stem).group()))\nesc = html.escape\nchapters = []\nfor path in files:\n    text = path.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig')\n    blocks = [re.sub(r'\\s+', ' ', b).strip() for b in re.split(r'\\n\\s*\\n', text.strip()) if b.strip()]\n    chapters.append((blocks[0], blocks[1:]))\nuid = 'urn:uuid:' + str(uuid.uuid4())\nmodified = datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ')\n\ndef xhtml(title, body):\n    return '<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\\n<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:epub=\"http://www.idpf.org/2007/ops\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><head><title>' + esc(title) + '</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"style.css\"/></head><body>' + body + '</body></html>'\n\nentri"]
[52.830855, "i", "es = {}\nentries['META-INF/container.xml'] = '<?xml version=\"1.0\"?><container version=\"1.0\" xmlns=\"urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:container\"><rootfiles><rootfile full-path=\"OEBPS/content.opf\" media-type=\"application/oebps-package+xml\"/></rootfiles></container>'\nentries['OEBPS/style.css'] = 'body {font-family: serif; line-height: 1.5; margin: 5%;} h1 {font-size: 1.5em; text-align: center; margin: 1.5em 0;} p {margin: 0 0 0.6em; text-indent: 1.2em;} nav ol {padding-left: 1.5em;} nav li {margin: 0.8em 0;}'\nlinks = ''.join(f'<li><a href=\"chapter{i}.xhtml\">{esc(title)}</a></li>' for i, (title, _) in enumerate(chapters, 1))\nentries['OEBPS/nav.xhtml'] = xhtml('Pass Through — Contents', '<h1>Pass Through</h1><nav epub:type=\"toc\" id=\"toc\"><h2>Contents</h2><ol>' + links + '</ol></nav>')\nfor i, (title, paragraphs) in enumerate(chapters, 1):\n    entries[f'OEBPS/chapter{i}.xhtml'] = xhtml(title, '<h1>' + esc(title) + '</h1>' + ''.join('<p>' + esc(p) + '</p>' for p in paragraphs))\nmanifest = '<item id=\"nav\" href=\"n"]
[52.831017, "i", "av.xhtml\" media-type=\"application/xhtml+xml\" properties=\"nav\"/><item id=\"ncx\" href=\"toc.ncx\" media-type=\"application/x-dtbncx+xml\"/><item id=\"css\" href=\"style.css\" media-type=\"text/css\"/>'\nmanifest += ''.join(f'<item id=\"ch{i}\" href=\"chapter{i}.xhtml\" media-type=\"application/xhtml+xml\"/>' for i in range(1, len(chapters)+1))\nspine = '<itemref idref=\"nav\"/>' + ''.join(f'<itemref idref=\"ch{i}\"/>' for i in range(1,len(chapters)+1))\nentries['OEBPS/content.opf'] = f'''<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?><package xmlns=\"http://www.idpf.org/2007/opf\" version=\"3.0\" unique-identifier=\"book-id\" xml:lang=\"en\"><metadata xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"><dc:identifier id=\"book-id\">{uid}</dc:identifier><dc:title>Pass Through</dc:title><dc:language>en</dc:language><meta property=\"dcterms:modified\">{modified}</meta></metadata><manifest>{manifest}</manifest><spine toc=\"ncx\">{spine}</spine></package>'''\npoints = ''.join(f'<navPoint id=\"ch{i}\" playOrder=\"{i}\"><navLabel><text>{esc(title)}</text></navLabel><content sr"]
